text = "Type the encrypted secret code you have found in the LineEdit under.
If you typed the right secret code, the safe door will open. If you typed the wrong one, two things can happens:
- The safe door won't open, and you will have to find where you failed (for baby mode only)
- Diego will kill you and you're yo mama with the \"Mario when he dance zoomba with a Goonba\" method (for normal mode only, so not for the Web version of the game)

To leave this, just click outside of the LineEdit."
